      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've seen thumbnails load slowly but it's like a one second delay between each one, and usually caching would hide this. Like I have 50 favorite avatars, and I'm not exactly changing more than two a night, but I've seen it delay loading thumbnails like caching is not working",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
