      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Okay wow, important information -- the problem that I described happens on my PC (a powerful gaming PC with an SSD), but I decided to try running VRChat on my Steam Deck to see if it happens there, and I can now confirm:  it does NOT.    To repeat: thumbnails load VERY VERY SLOWLY on my gaming PC, but almost INSTANTLY on my Steam Deck.   So it's clearly not something wrong with the client, not the servers!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
