      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Oh my god.  \"Clear Content Cache\" (and the other two buttons near it) fixed it.   We'll see whether it'll inevitably gradually slow down again, or whether this was a fix for a rare glitched state that won't repeat.... but either way, at least the fix is easy.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
