      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "OK, after some experimentation, I can now pretty safely confirm that \"clear texture cache\" is the button that fixes it.  And the good news is, it doesn't even require a relaunch!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
