  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Open the \"worlds\" menu\n\n3. Open the 'New' category (for example)\n\n4. Scroll down past the first screenful of results\n\n5. Wait for the thumbnails to load.\n\nI'm not exaggerating when I say it's *much* faster to load an entire 100+MB world, than it is to wait for a single thumbnail to load.   This makes me think it must be some kind of bug, and not just a sudden huge budget slash on the VRChat content servers or something....",
